<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McDonald's EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McDonald's EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown analyst David Trossman said he reduced his earnings estimates on McDonald's Corp to $2.50 per share from $2.55 for 1997, and to $1.85 from $1.90 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- said the reduction was due in part to reported expectations that the fast food giant would cut prices on its bugers.</p>
<p>-- also said he was brining his estimates more in line with the Wall Street consensus.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 44-7/8 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
